%% Approval lifecycle state machine. Explained in: docs/components/Approval_Engine.md
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: require_approval (action frozen, hash bound)
    pending --> approved: human approves exact action
    pending --> rejected: human rejects
    pending --> expired: TTL elapses (AEGIS_APPROVAL_TTL_SECS)
    pending --> pending: edit → re-hash + re-evaluate
    approved --> consumed: POST /:id/consume (single-use, atomic)
    approved --> expired: TTL elapses unconsumed
    consumed --> [*]: SDK re-checks hash → execute
    rejected --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
